PXA LCD Controller
------------------

Required properties:
 - compatible : one of these
	"marvell,pxa2xx-lcdc",
	"marvell,pxa270-lcdc",
	"marvell,pxa300-lcdc"
 - reg : should contain 1 register range (address and length).
