Optional properties:

  - maxim,vmon-slot-no : slot number used to send voltage information
                   or in inteleave mode this will be used as
                   interleave slot.
                   slot range : 0 ~ 15,  Default : 0

  - maxim,imon-slot-no : slot number used to send current information
                   slot range : 0 ~ 15,  Default : 0

